     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-background-native-american-category</b></p><a name=\"ahip-background-native-american-category\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-background-native-american-category\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.5.0/CodeSystem-CDCREC.html\"><code>urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113883.6.238</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>1010-8</td><td>Apache</td></tr><tr><td>4111-1</td><td>Aztec</td></tr><tr><td>1035-5</td><td>Blackfeet</td></tr><tr><td>1088-4</td><td>Cherokee</td></tr><tr><td>1102-3</td><td>Cheyenne</td></tr><tr><td>1123-9</td><td>Chippewa</td></tr><tr><td>1155-1</td><td>Choctaw</td></tr><tr><td>3109-6</td><td>Comanche</td></tr><tr><td>3745-7</td><td>Inupiat</td></tr><tr><td>1340-9</td><td>Lumbee</td></tr><tr><td>1833-3</td><td>Lingít (Tlingit)</td></tr><tr><td>4185-5</td><td>Maya</td></tr><tr><td>3321-7</td><td>Navajo</td></tr><tr><td>1407-6</td><td>Osage</td></tr><tr><td>1609-7</td><td>Sioux</td></tr><tr><td>4178-0</td><td>Taino</td></tr><tr><td>1896-0</td><td>Yup'ik Eskimo</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-temporary-codes.html\"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/us/demographic-collect/CodeSystem/ahip-demo-temporary-codes</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.1.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-temporary-codes.html#ahip-demo-temporary-codes-9999-1\">9999-1</a></td><td>Athabascan</td><td>Self-identified Athabascan background. Temporary code expected to move to CDCREC.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-temporary-codes.html#ahip-demo-temporary-codes-9999-2\">9999-2</a></td><td>Haudenosaunee</td><td>Self-identified Haudenosaunee background. Temporary code expected to move to CDCREC.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-temporary-codes.html#ahip-demo-temporary-codes-9999-4\">9999-4</a></td><td>Muscogee (Eastern, Lower, Star Clan)</td><td>Self-identified Muscogee background, including Eastern, Lower, and Star Clan. Temporary code expected to move to CDCREC.</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor</code></a><span title=\"Version is explicitly stated to be 4.0.0\"> version ?4.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.4.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html#v3-NullFlavor-ASKU\">ASKU</a></td><td>I don't know</td><td>Information was sought but not found (e.g., patient was asked but didn't know)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-additional-nullFlavor.html\"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/us/demographic-collect/CodeSystem/ahip-demo-additional-nullFlavor</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.1.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ahip-demo-additional-nullFlavor.html#ahip-demo-additional-nullFlavor-CNTR\">CNTR</a></td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td><td>This code is to represent explicitly that the patient has chosen not to respond to this question at this time.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
